[
  {"beat": 1, "identifier": "gJlv4IPSXO", "start_s": 0.0, "end_s": 4.8, "timestamp": "00m00s-00m05s", "filename": "001_00m00s-00m05s.png", "text": "The screen lights up Alex's face in the dark. 11:47pm, Friday."},
  {"beat": 2, "identifier": "ONJQRQsynm", "start_s": 4.8, "end_s": 11.34, "timestamp": "00m05s-00m11s", "filename": "002_00m05s-00m11s.png", "text": "\"24-HOUR SALE — 30% OFF. ENDS TONIGHT.\" His thumb moves before he's finished reading it."},
  {"beat": 3, "identifier": "DBMPt30pcl", "start_s": 11.34, "end_s": 16.14, "timestamp": "00m11s-00m16s", "filename": "003_00m11s-00m16s.png", "text": "He doesn't buy. Not yet — not for three more hours."},
  {"beat": 4, "identifier": "3Gi1W7qREY", "start_s": 16.14, "end_s": 19.19, "timestamp": "00m16s-00m19s", "filename": "004_00m16s-00m19s.png", "text": "At 2:50am, he finally taps \"confirm order.\""},
  {"beat": 5, "identifier": "1skBUbvr4r", "start_s": 19.19, "end_s": 23.99, "timestamp": "00m19s-00m24s", "filename": "005_00m19s-00m24s.png", "text": "Ask him when he decided, and he'll say right now. 2:50am."},
  {"beat": 6, "identifier": "rl1o7j2xtc", "start_s": 23.99, "end_s": 30.1, "timestamp": "00m24s-00m30s", "filename": "006_00m24s-00m30s.png", "text": "He's wrong. The decision happened at 11:47pm — the instant the screen lit up."},
  {"beat": 7, "identifier": "DBMPm8upcl", "start_s": 30.1, "end_s": 35.77, "timestamp": "00m30s-00m36s", "filename": "007_00m30s-00m36s.png", "text": "Three hours he didn't need. The transaction was already finished, in his head."},
  {"beat": 8, "identifier": "fFaYK1bCDY", "start_s": 35.77, "end_s": 42.75, "timestamp": "00m36s-00m43s", "filename": "008_00m36s-00m43s.png", "text": "By the time money changed hands, his brain had already cashed in and left the building."},
  {"beat": 9, "identifier": "gJlv9ZFSXO", "start_s": 42.75, "end_s": 48.42, "timestamp": "00m43s-00m48s", "filename": "009_00m43s-00m48s.png", "text": "Multiply that by every notification this year, and the pattern gets expensive fast."},
  {"beat": 10, "identifier": "WMYUXC8cXe", "start_s": 48.42, "end_s": 51.91, "timestamp": "00m48s-00m52s", "filename": "010_00m48s-00m52s.png", "text": "Here's what nobody tells you about impulse spending."},
  {"beat": 11, "identifier": "Xtd61bKBfo", "start_s": 51.91, "end_s": 54.96, "timestamp": "00m52s-00m55s", "filename": "011_00m52s-00m55s.png", "text": "It's not that you're weak at 3am."},
  {"beat": 12, "identifier": "LUjtGGWswO", "start_s": 54.96, "end_s": 61.07, "timestamp": "00m55s-01m01s", "filename": "012_00m55s-01m01s.png", "text": "It's that your brain already got its reward before you ever paid for anything."},
  {"beat": 13, "identifier": "SOgaWMzUb8", "start_s": 61.07, "end_s": 64.12, "timestamp": "01m01s-01m04s", "filename": "013_01m01s-01m04s.png", "text": "Three traps run this system. Not one."},
  {"beat": 14, "identifier": "ohB3xAB829", "start_s": 64.12, "end_s": 66.74, "timestamp": "01m04s-01m07s", "filename": "014_01m04s-01m07s.png", "text": "The first one feels like excitement."},
  {"beat": 15, "identifier": "MXVyqRVDCm", "start_s": 66.74, "end_s": 69.36, "timestamp": "01m07s-01m09s", "filename": "015_01m07s-01m09s.png", "text": "The second one feels like relief."},
  {"beat": 16, "identifier": "vuhzSBla47", "start_s": 69.36, "end_s": 75.03, "timestamp": "01m09s-01m15s", "filename": "016_01m09s-01m15s.png", "text": "The third one — the one nobody suspects — feels like moving on."},
  {"beat": 17, "identifier": "ONJQMwwynm", "start_s": 75.03, "end_s": 80.26, "timestamp": "01m15s-01m20s", "filename": "017_01m15s-01m20s.png", "text": "Let's time this out to the minute, so nothing gets rewritten later."},
  {"beat": 18, "identifier": "J97uMTaOq4", "start_s": 80.26, "end_s": 87.68, "timestamp": "01m20s-01m28s", "filename": "018_01m20s-01m28s.png", "text": "Six months ago, Alex got the same kind of notification. He didn't buy anything that day either."},
  {"beat": 19, "identifier": "y6OFpXJPW9", "start_s": 87.68, "end_s": 95.1, "timestamp": "01m28s-01m35s", "filename": "019_01m28s-01m35s.png", "text": "His heart rate still climbed. His thumb still reached for the phone before his brain caught up."},
  {"beat": 20, "identifier": "xgr8ATTjfW", "start_s": 95.1, "end_s": 103.38, "timestamp": "01m35s-01m43s", "filename": "020_01m35s-01m43s.png", "text": "Wolfram Schultz — University of Cambridge — ran an experiment with monkeys, a light, and a squirt of juice."},
  {"beat": 21, "identifier": "swLmnXxl8e", "start_s": 103.38, "end_s": 108.18, "timestamp": "01m43s-01m48s", "filename": "021_01m43s-01m48s.png", "text": "Every time the light came on, juice followed two seconds later."},
  {"beat": 22, "identifier": "74wEDDQJAL", "start_s": 108.18, "end_s": 112.11, "timestamp": "01m48s-01m52s", "filename": "022_01m48s-01m52s.png", "text": "Schultz measured the monkeys' dopamine neurons the entire time."},
  {"beat": 23, "identifier": "UySfVeUwny", "start_s": 112.11, "end_s": 116.03, "timestamp": "01m52s-01m56s", "filename": "023_01m52s-01m56s.png", "text": "At first, the neurons fired when the juice arrived."},
  {"beat": 24, "identifier": "62NKIQXiJO", "start_s": 116.03, "end_s": 118.65, "timestamp": "01m56s-01m59s", "filename": "024_01m56s-01m59s.png", "text": "After a few repetitions, something changed."},
  {"beat": 25, "identifier": "J97upfxOq4", "start_s": 118.65, "end_s": 121.71, "timestamp": "01m59s-02m02s", "filename": "025_01m59s-02m02s.png", "text": "The neurons stopped firing for the juice."},
  {"beat": 26, "identifier": "ubE04VGQLD", "start_s": 121.71, "end_s": 123.89, "timestamp": "02m02s-02m04s", "filename": "026_02m02s-02m04s.png", "text": "They fired for the light."},
  {"beat": 27, "identifier": "hEmGwT2vqL", "start_s": 123.89, "end_s": 129.56, "timestamp": "02m04s-02m10s", "filename": "027_02m04s-02m10s.png", "text": "Not a metaphor. A measured shift in exactly which moment produces the chemical."},
  {"beat": 28, "identifier": "3Gi1tDsREY", "start_s": 129.56, "end_s": 132.17, "timestamp": "02m10s-02m12s", "filename": "028_02m10s-02m12s.png", "text": "Researchers call this reward prediction error."},
  {"beat": 29, "identifier": "1skB26Hr4r", "start_s": 132.17, "end_s": 136.54, "timestamp": "02m12s-02m17s", "filename": "029_02m12s-02m17s.png", "text": "The brain doesn't reward you for getting what you expected."},
  {"beat": 30, "identifier": "WMYUQQ0cXe", "start_s": 136.54, "end_s": 141.77, "timestamp": "02m17s-02m22s", "filename": "030_02m17s-02m22s.png", "text": "It rewards you for the signal that something good might be coming."},
  {"beat": 31, "identifier": "1skBGcLr4r", "start_s": 141.77, "end_s": 144.39, "timestamp": "02m22s-02m24s", "filename": "031_02m22s-02m24s.png", "text": "We call this the Maybe Hit."},
  {"beat": 32, "identifier": "xgr8Ym4jfW", "start_s": 144.39, "end_s": 147.44, "timestamp": "02m24s-02m27s", "filename": "032_02m24s-02m27s.png", "text": "That's what happened to Alex at 11:47pm."},
  {"beat": 33, "identifier": "rl1ozq1xtc", "start_s": 147.44, "end_s": 152.24, "timestamp": "02m27s-02m32s", "filename": "033_02m27s-02m32s.png", "text": "The notification was the light. The 30% discount was the juice."},
  {"beat": 34, "identifier": "J97ue72Oq4", "start_s": 152.24, "end_s": 157.04, "timestamp": "02m32s-02m37s", "filename": "034_02m32s-02m37s.png", "text": "His dopamine had already fired in bed, three hours before checkout."},
  {"beat": 35, "identifier": "PiyHoin42C", "start_s": 157.04, "end_s": 158.78, "timestamp": "02m37s-02m39s", "filename": "035_02m37s-02m39s.png", "text": "Not because he's impulsive."},
  {"beat": 36, "identifier": "LUjtcOzswO", "start_s": 158.78, "end_s": 164.02, "timestamp": "02m39s-02m44s", "filename": "036_02m39s-02m44s.png", "text": "But because his brain already got paid the moment the \"maybe\" appeared."},
  {"beat": 37, "identifier": "Ia8ZUqKtvE", "start_s": 164.02, "end_s": 167.94, "timestamp": "02m44s-02m48s", "filename": "037_02m44s-02m48s.png", "text": "This isn't a lack of self-control. This is neuroscience."},
  {"beat": 38, "identifier": "LUjtcR3swO", "start_s": 167.94, "end_s": 171.87, "timestamp": "02m48s-02m52s", "filename": "038_02m48s-02m52s.png", "text": "The purchase itself, at 2:50am, was almost chemically irrelevant."},
  {"beat": 39, "identifier": "e8p9jkkdqL", "start_s": 171.87, "end_s": 177.11, "timestamp": "02m52s-02m57s", "filename": "039_02m52s-02m57s.png", "text": "The Brain Villain had already collected its reward and left the room."},
  {"beat": 40, "identifier": "hEmGJJrvqL", "start_s": 177.11, "end_s": 181.9, "timestamp": "02m57s-03m02s", "filename": "040_02m57s-03m02s.png", "text": "That's the first trap. It doesn't feel like a chemical event."},
  {"beat": 41, "identifier": "rl1oncFxtc", "start_s": 181.9, "end_s": 183.65, "timestamp": "03m02s-03m04s", "filename": "041_03m02s-03m04s.png", "text": "It feels like excitement."},
  {"beat": 42, "identifier": "NZ95ma26D9", "start_s": 183.65, "end_s": 188.88, "timestamp": "03m04s-03m09s", "filename": "042_03m04s-03m09s.png", "text": "If your brain is doing this to you right now — subscribe."},
  {"beat": 43, "identifier": "nTzgHrQYQD", "start_s": 188.88, "end_s": 192.37, "timestamp": "03m09s-03m12s", "filename": "043_03m09s-03m12s.png", "text": "We break down a new bias every week."},
  {"beat": 44, "identifier": "5xbeADDKxe", "start_s": 192.37, "end_s": 193.25, "timestamp": "03m12s-03m13s", "filename": "044_03m12s-03m13s.png", "text": "It's free."},
  {"beat": 45, "identifier": "dIeNsi3XSL", "start_s": 193.25, "end_s": 197.17, "timestamp": "03m13s-03m17s", "filename": "045_03m13s-03m17s.png", "text": "And it might save you more than you think."},
  {"beat": 46, "identifier": "62NKhPKiJO", "start_s": 197.17, "end_s": 200.66, "timestamp": "03m17s-03m21s", "filename": "046_03m17s-03m21s.png", "text": "Two days after the sale, the package arrived."},
  {"beat": 47, "identifier": "e8p9lSsdqL", "start_s": 200.66, "end_s": 205.02, "timestamp": "03m21s-03m25s", "filename": "047_03m21s-03m25s.png", "text": "Alex felt genuinely happy opening it. For about a day."},
  {"beat": 48, "identifier": "wPUCXmE7EI", "start_s": 205.02, "end_s": 209.39, "timestamp": "03m25s-03m29s", "filename": "048_03m25s-03m29s.png", "text": "By day three, the item was just there. Furniture. Background."},
  {"beat": 49, "identifier": "ubE03kvQLD", "start_s": 209.39, "end_s": 215.06, "timestamp": "03m29s-03m35s", "filename": "049_03m29s-03m35s.png", "text": "He didn't return it. It wasn't bad. It just stopped registering as anything."},
  {"beat": 50, "identifier": "xgr8cpsjfW", "start_s": 215.06, "end_s": 221.16, "timestamp": "03m35s-03m41s", "filename": "050_03m35s-03m41s.png", "text": "Leaf Van Boven and Thomas Gilovich — Cornell University — studied exactly this fade."},
  {"beat": 51, "identifier": "WMYU5UIcXe", "start_s": 221.16, "end_s": 227.71, "timestamp": "03m41s-03m48s", "filename": "051_03m41s-03m48s.png", "text": "They compared people who spent money on things versus people who spent money on experiences."},
  {"beat": 52, "identifier": "kLKXYkr16B", "start_s": 227.71, "end_s": 231.63, "timestamp": "03m48s-03m52s", "filename": "052_03m48s-03m52s.png", "text": "Both groups felt the same happiness on day one."},
  {"beat": 53, "identifier": "SOgady5Ub8", "start_s": 231.63, "end_s": 236.43, "timestamp": "03m52s-03m56s", "filename": "053_03m52s-03m56s.png", "text": "By the follow-up, the material purchases had faded. The experiences hadn't."},
  {"beat": 54, "identifier": "ubE0RraQLD", "start_s": 236.43, "end_s": 238.61, "timestamp": "03m56s-03m59s", "filename": "054_03m56s-03m59s.png", "text": "Not because objects are worthless."},
  {"beat": 55, "identifier": "BmXiwFcoQR", "start_s": 238.61, "end_s": 243.85, "timestamp": "03m59s-04m04s", "filename": "055_03m59s-04m04s.png", "text": "But because a static object gives your brain nothing new to predict."},
  {"beat": 56, "identifier": "aQvnNsGfSh", "start_s": 243.85, "end_s": 249.08, "timestamp": "04m04s-04m09s", "filename": "056_04m04s-04m09s.png", "text": "Once it's sitting on your shelf, there's no \"maybe\" left in it."},
  {"beat": 57, "identifier": "LUjtTVmswO", "start_s": 249.08, "end_s": 251.7, "timestamp": "04m09s-04m12s", "filename": "057_04m09s-04m12s.png", "text": "We call this the 48-Hour Fade."},
  {"beat": 58, "identifier": "rl1oWhaxtc", "start_s": 251.7, "end_s": 257.37, "timestamp": "04m12s-04m17s", "filename": "058_04m12s-04m17s.png", "text": "Alex has fourteen of these purchases sitting in drawers from this year alone."},
  {"beat": 59, "identifier": "BmXi7EzoQR", "start_s": 257.37, "end_s": 263.48, "timestamp": "04m17s-04m23s", "filename": "059_04m17s-04m23s.png", "text": "Two thousand eight hundred seventy euros. Almost none of it still feels like anything."},
  {"beat": 60, "identifier": "0pc7xhZTfW", "start_s": 263.48, "end_s": 266.97, "timestamp": "04m23s-04m27s", "filename": "060_04m23s-04m27s.png", "text": "Fourteen separate \"maybe\" moments. Fourteen separate 3am checkouts."},
  {"beat": 61, "identifier": "ubE0ZwqQLD", "start_s": 266.97, "end_s": 271.33, "timestamp": "04m27s-04m31s", "filename": "061_04m27s-04m31s.png", "text": "None of the fourteen items were ever really the point."},
  {"beat": 62, "identifier": "wPUCoTp7EI", "start_s": 271.33, "end_s": 277.0, "timestamp": "04m31s-04m37s", "filename": "062_04m31s-04m37s.png", "text": "They were just receipts for a feeling that had already happened hours earlier."},
  {"beat": 63, "identifier": "y6OFmosPW9", "start_s": 277.0, "end_s": 282.23, "timestamp": "04m37s-04m42s", "filename": "063_04m37s-04m42s.png", "text": "The trap doesn't feel like a trap. It feels like a virtue."},
  {"beat": 64, "identifier": "kLKXcc216B", "start_s": 282.23, "end_s": 288.78, "timestamp": "04m42s-04m49s", "filename": "064_04m42s-04m49s.png", "text": "\"I earned this\" sounds like self-respect. It's the Brain Villain, wearing self-respect as a costume."},
  {"beat": 65, "identifier": "LUjtDXaswO", "start_s": 288.78, "end_s": 292.27, "timestamp": "04m49s-04m52s", "filename": "065_04m49s-04m52s.png", "text": "Not because he doesn't appreciate what he owns."},
  {"beat": 66, "identifier": "jSxIM8HLD0", "start_s": 292.27, "end_s": 297.5, "timestamp": "04m52s-04m58s", "filename": "066_04m52s-04m58s.png", "text": "But because appreciation was never the chemical that made him buy it."},
  {"beat": 67, "identifier": "swLmpaxl8e", "start_s": 297.5, "end_s": 303.61, "timestamp": "04m58s-05m04s", "filename": "067_04m58s-05m04s.png", "text": "This is why the fifteenth sale notification works exactly as well as the first."},
  {"beat": 68, "identifier": "poD4gZBehw", "start_s": 303.61, "end_s": 311.9, "timestamp": "05m04s-05m12s", "filename": "068_05m04s-05m12s.png", "text": "Each one is a brand new \"maybe\" — a fresh hit, unrelated to whether the last one satisfied you."},
  {"beat": 69, "identifier": "NZ95fSB6D9", "start_s": 311.9, "end_s": 317.13, "timestamp": "05m12s-05m17s", "filename": "069_05m12s-05m17s.png", "text": "Your closet fills up. Your dopamine account resets to zero every time."},
  {"beat": 70, "identifier": "SOgaXrtUb8", "start_s": 317.13, "end_s": 323.67, "timestamp": "05m17s-05m24s", "filename": "070_05m17s-05m24s.png", "text": "That's the second trap. It doesn't feel like the fade coming. It feels like relief."},
  {"beat": 71, "identifier": "poD4SRdehw", "start_s": 323.67, "end_s": 330.22, "timestamp": "05m24s-05m30s", "filename": "071_05m24s-05m30s.png", "text": "Here's the trap that doesn't announce itself, because it looks like the story ending well."},
  {"beat": 72, "identifier": "CHfWRXKEEy", "start_s": 330.22, "end_s": 334.14, "timestamp": "05m30s-05m34s", "filename": "072_05m30s-05m34s.png", "text": "Go back to Schultz's monkeys for one more detail."},
  {"beat": 73, "identifier": "ohB3OVd829", "start_s": 334.14, "end_s": 338.51, "timestamp": "05m34s-05m39s", "filename": "073_05m34s-05m39s.png", "text": "Once the light reliably predicted the juice, something else happened."},
  {"beat": 74, "identifier": "WMYUrzbcXe", "start_s": 338.51, "end_s": 343.3, "timestamp": "05m39s-05m43s", "filename": "074_05m39s-05m43s.png", "text": "The dopamine neurons went quiet — eventually, for the light too."},
  {"beat": 75, "identifier": "Xtd6Jo0Bfo", "start_s": 343.3, "end_s": 347.67, "timestamp": "05m43s-05m48s", "filename": "075_05m43s-05m48s.png", "text": "A fully predictable reward stops producing the chemical at all."},
  {"beat": 76, "identifier": "NZ95EAH6D9", "start_s": 347.67, "end_s": 352.03, "timestamp": "05m48s-05m52s", "filename": "076_05m48s-05m52s.png", "text": "The system runs on uncertainty. Guaranteed good things bore it."},
  {"beat": 77, "identifier": "jSxIpy9LD0", "start_s": 352.03, "end_s": 358.57, "timestamp": "05m52s-05m59s", "filename": "077_05m52s-05m59s.png", "text": "So the day after Alex's package arrived and the excitement faded, his brain didn't rest."},
  {"beat": 78, "identifier": "43Pqf0E9Aa", "start_s": 358.57, "end_s": 361.63, "timestamp": "05m59s-06m02s", "filename": "078_05m59s-06m02s.png", "text": "It went looking for the next \"maybe.\""},
  {"beat": 79, "identifier": "hEmG6lfvqL", "start_s": 361.63, "end_s": 363.81, "timestamp": "06m02s-06m04s", "filename": "079_06m02s-06m04s.png", "text": "Not because Alex decided to."},
  {"beat": 80, "identifier": "9R4bCoJNYZ", "start_s": 363.81, "end_s": 371.22, "timestamp": "06m04s-06m11s", "filename": "080_06m04s-06m11s.png", "text": "But because a satisfied prediction system has nothing left to do but search for a new one."},
  {"beat": 81, "identifier": "rl1oD40xtc", "start_s": 371.22, "end_s": 375.15, "timestamp": "06m11s-06m15s", "filename": "081_06m11s-06m15s.png", "text": "This isn't a lack of discipline. This is neuroscience."},
  {"beat": 82, "identifier": "YVnSjYlWeC", "start_s": 375.15, "end_s": 381.26, "timestamp": "06m15s-06m21s", "filename": "082_06m15s-06m21s.png", "text": "It's a chemical system that treats \"problem solved\" as \"please generate a new problem.\""},
  {"beat": 83, "identifier": "0pc7lewTfW", "start_s": 381.26, "end_s": 383.87, "timestamp": "06m21s-06m24s", "filename": "083_06m21s-06m24s.png", "text": "We call this the Empty Refill."},
  {"beat": 84, "identifier": "y6OFf2tPW9", "start_s": 383.87, "end_s": 388.24, "timestamp": "06m24s-06m28s", "filename": "084_06m24s-06m28s.png", "text": "It's the reason one purchase becomes three purchases becomes fourteen."},
  {"beat": 85, "identifier": "xgr8e4djfW", "start_s": 388.24, "end_s": 390.42, "timestamp": "06m28s-06m30s", "filename": "085_06m28s-06m30s.png", "text": "Not escalating want. Escalating search."},
  {"beat": 86, "identifier": "dIeNO5EXSL", "start_s": 390.42, "end_s": 395.21, "timestamp": "06m30s-06m35s", "filename": "086_06m30s-06m35s.png", "text": "The scariest part: it feels like the opposite of a trap."},
  {"beat": 87, "identifier": "swLmBYyl8e", "start_s": 395.21, "end_s": 402.63, "timestamp": "06m35s-06m43s", "filename": "087_06m35s-06m43s.png", "text": "It feels like moving on — from one small treat to the next, healthily, like anyone would."},
  {"beat": 88, "identifier": "1skBDzhr4r", "start_s": 402.63, "end_s": 408.3, "timestamp": "06m43s-06m48s", "filename": "088_06m43s-06m48s.png", "text": "Alex would tell you he just likes finding good deals. That's not wrong."},
  {"beat": 89, "identifier": "8voR9JiIrU", "start_s": 408.3, "end_s": 413.1, "timestamp": "06m48s-06m53s", "filename": "089_06m48s-06m53s.png", "text": "It's also exactly what the mechanism wants him to call it."},
  {"beat": 90, "identifier": "9R4buu3NYZ", "start_s": 413.1, "end_s": 418.77, "timestamp": "06m53s-06m59s", "filename": "090_06m53s-06m59s.png", "text": "A system built to search never runs out of things to search for."},
  {"beat": 91, "identifier": "YVnSjShWeC", "start_s": 418.77, "end_s": 426.19, "timestamp": "06m59s-07m06s", "filename": "091_06m59s-07m06s.png", "text": "It's the trap nobody suspects, because it doesn't feel like fear, and it doesn't feel like relief."},
  {"beat": 92, "identifier": "DBMPwNxpcl", "start_s": 426.19, "end_s": 430.11, "timestamp": "07m06s-07m10s", "filename": "092_07m06s-07m10s.png", "text": "It feels like a person who just likes shopping."},
  {"beat": 93, "identifier": "Ia8ZNW2tvE", "start_s": 430.11, "end_s": 434.04, "timestamp": "07m10s-07m14s", "filename": "093_07m10s-07m14s.png", "text": "Same circuit. Same chemical. Wearing a completely different outfit."},
  {"beat": 94, "identifier": "62NKHJviJO", "start_s": 434.04, "end_s": 435.78, "timestamp": "07m14s-07m16s", "filename": "094_07m14s-07m16s.png", "text": "Now, an honest counter."},
  {"beat": 95, "identifier": "rl1oeKQxtc", "start_s": 435.78, "end_s": 439.27, "timestamp": "07m16s-07m19s", "filename": "095_07m16s-07m19s.png", "text": "Not every night purchase is the Maybe Hit."},
  {"beat": 96, "identifier": "poD4OXEehw", "start_s": 439.27, "end_s": 448.87, "timestamp": "07m19s-07m29s", "filename": "096_07m19s-07m29s.png", "text": "Real signal: you needed the item before you saw the notification, and you'd have bought it at full price next week anyway."},
  {"beat": 97, "identifier": "UySfh9pwny", "start_s": 448.87, "end_s": 456.72, "timestamp": "07m29s-07m37s", "filename": "097_07m29s-07m37s.png", "text": "Non-signal: you didn't know the product existed forty minutes ago, and there's a countdown timer on the screen."},
  {"beat": 98, "identifier": "74wEa2YJAL", "start_s": 456.72, "end_s": 462.39, "timestamp": "07m37s-07m42s", "filename": "098_07m37s-07m42s.png", "text": "This isn't a rule that says \"never buy anything you feel excited about.\""},
  {"beat": 99, "identifier": "SOgamGKUb8", "start_s": 462.39, "end_s": 469.81, "timestamp": "07m42s-07m50s", "filename": "099_07m42s-07m50s.png", "text": "It's a rule that says: notice whether the want existed before the \"maybe\" showed up, or after."},
  {"beat": 100, "identifier": "brqpVNq5Y2", "start_s": 469.81, "end_s": 474.61, "timestamp": "07m50s-07m55s", "filename": "100_07m50s-07m55s.png", "text": "If you can name the need from yesterday — buy it."},
  {"beat": 101, "identifier": "rl1otdGxtc", "start_s": 474.61, "end_s": 482.89, "timestamp": "07m55s-08m03s", "filename": "101_07m55s-08m03s.png", "text": "If the only thing that changed is a red countdown clock — that's the Brain Villain, not a need."},
  {"beat": 102, "identifier": "ONJQERsynm", "start_s": 482.89, "end_s": 487.26, "timestamp": "08m03s-08m07s", "filename": "102_08m03s-08m07s.png", "text": "The goal was never to feel zero anticipation ever again."},
  {"beat": 103, "identifier": "swLmI6rl8e", "start_s": 487.26, "end_s": 492.06, "timestamp": "08m07s-08m12s", "filename": "103_08m07s-08m12s.png", "text": "Schultz's monkeys couldn't opt out of the mechanism. Neither can you."},
  {"beat": 104, "identifier": "ubE0WwfQLD", "start_s": 492.06, "end_s": 496.85, "timestamp": "08m12s-08m17s", "filename": "104_08m12s-08m17s.png", "text": "The goal is noticing which moment the \"yes\" actually happened in."},
  {"beat": 105, "identifier": "DBMP62kpcl", "start_s": 496.85, "end_s": 501.65, "timestamp": "08m17s-08m22s", "filename": "105_08m17s-08m22s.png", "text": "None of these three run alone. They're one loop, feeding itself."},
  {"beat": 106, "identifier": "ONJQbsIynm", "start_s": 501.65, "end_s": 511.25, "timestamp": "08m22s-08m31s", "filename": "106_08m22s-08m31s.png", "text": "The Maybe Hit is the operating system. The 48-Hour Fade and the Empty Refill are the applications running on top of it."},
  {"beat": 107, "identifier": "EqCcMvLuuO", "start_s": 511.25, "end_s": 518.23, "timestamp": "08m31s-08m38s", "filename": "107_08m31s-08m38s.png", "text": "That number again. Two thousand eight hundred seventy euros, on items that stopped registering within days."},
  {"beat": 108, "identifier": "Te0J40iVNR", "start_s": 518.23, "end_s": 527.39, "timestamp": "08m38s-08m47s", "filename": "108_08m38s-08m47s.png", "text": "Plus the hours spent scrolling for the next \"maybe\" — time that never shows up on any bank statement at all."},
  {"beat": 109, "identifier": "poD43omehw", "start_s": 527.39, "end_s": 530.01, "timestamp": "08m47s-08m50s", "filename": "109_08m47s-08m50s.png", "text": "Sit with that for a second."},
  {"beat": 110, "identifier": "kLKXtgv16B", "start_s": 530.01, "end_s": 533.93, "timestamp": "08m50s-08m54s", "filename": "110_08m50s-08m54s.png", "text": "All three are powered by the exact same fuel."},
  {"beat": 111, "identifier": "3Gi1sToREY", "start_s": 533.93, "end_s": 539.6, "timestamp": "08m54s-09m00s", "filename": "111_08m54s-09m00s.png", "text": "To your brain, uncertainty is not a distraction. Uncertainty is the entire reward."},
  {"beat": 112, "identifier": "Ia8ZnAUtvE", "start_s": 539.6, "end_s": 543.53, "timestamp": "09m00s-09m04s", "filename": "112_09m00s-09m04s.png", "text": "See the notification — the Maybe Hit fires immediately."},
  {"beat": 113, "identifier": "vuhz00Ma47", "start_s": 543.53, "end_s": 548.33, "timestamp": "09m04s-09m08s", "filename": "113_09m04s-09m08s.png", "text": "Own the object — the Fade sets in within 48 hours."},
  {"beat": 114, "identifier": "8voRz0WIrU", "start_s": 548.33, "end_s": 554.0, "timestamp": "09m08s-09m14s", "filename": "114_09m08s-09m14s.png", "text": "Feel nothing left to want — the Empty Refill sends you looking again."},
  {"beat": 115, "identifier": "DBMPiWLpcl", "start_s": 554.0, "end_s": 559.67, "timestamp": "09m14s-09m20s", "filename": "115_09m14s-09m20s.png", "text": "Every one of Alex's \"treats\" was the Brain Villain successfully doing its job."},
  {"beat": 116, "identifier": "xgr8v1OjfW", "start_s": 559.67, "end_s": 563.6, "timestamp": "09m20s-09m24s", "filename": "116_09m20s-09m24s.png", "text": "Just not the job his bank account actually needed."},
  {"beat": 117, "identifier": "rl1ovLSxtc", "start_s": 563.6, "end_s": 569.27, "timestamp": "09m24s-09m29s", "filename": "117_09m24s-09m29s.png", "text": "None of this required Alex to be unhappy. That's what makes it invisible."},
  {"beat": 118, "identifier": "UySfHPGwny", "start_s": 569.27, "end_s": 572.32, "timestamp": "09m29s-09m32s", "filename": "118_09m29s-09m32s.png", "text": "It runs perfectly well disguised as contentment."},
  {"beat": 119, "identifier": "mCtAc9NhJQ", "start_s": 572.32, "end_s": 577.12, "timestamp": "09m32s-09m37s", "filename": "119_09m32s-09m37s.png", "text": "And here's the part that has nothing to do with willpower."},
  {"beat": 120, "identifier": "PiyH1uB42C", "start_s": 577.12, "end_s": 581.04, "timestamp": "09m37s-09m41s", "filename": "120_09m37s-09m41s.png", "text": "Alex has more self-control than most people he knows."},
  {"beat": 121, "identifier": "UySfHC1wny", "start_s": 581.04, "end_s": 586.28, "timestamp": "09m41s-09m46s", "filename": "121_09m41s-09m46s.png", "text": "It didn't matter. The mechanism doesn't check for willpower before it fires."},
  {"beat": 122, "identifier": "aQvnVTefSh", "start_s": 586.28, "end_s": 592.82, "timestamp": "09m46s-09m53s", "filename": "122_09m46s-09m53s.png", "text": "This scales with how many \"maybes\" reach your phone, not with how disciplined you are."},
  {"beat": 123, "identifier": "swLmEFFl8e", "start_s": 592.82, "end_s": 595.0, "timestamp": "09m53s-09m55s", "filename": "123_09m53s-09m55s.png", "text": "The programs are not broken."},
  {"beat": 124, "identifier": "74wEbjkJAL", "start_s": 595.0, "end_s": 606.35, "timestamp": "09m55s-10m06s", "filename": "124_09m55s-10m06s.png", "text": "They are perfectly designed for an environment where a new \"maybe\" — a berry bush, a chance encounter — was rare enough to be worth chasing."},
  {"beat": 125, "identifier": "8voRndDIrU", "start_s": 606.35, "end_s": 614.2, "timestamp": "10m06s-10m14s", "filename": "125_10m06s-10m14s.png", "text": "Your phone now generates hundreds of \"maybes\" a day. Your brain still chases every one like it's rare."},
  {"beat": 126, "identifier": "ONJQkFYynm", "start_s": 614.2, "end_s": 618.12, "timestamp": "10m14s-10m18s", "filename": "126_10m14s-10m18s.png", "text": "Alex isn't shallow. Alex isn't bad at managing money."},
  {"beat": 127, "identifier": "VdTO3q9MMU", "start_s": 618.12, "end_s": 628.16, "timestamp": "10m18s-10m28s", "filename": "127_10m18s-10m28s.png", "text": "Alex has a brain built for a world with one rare \"maybe\" a month, running a phone that offers a hundred a day."},
  {"beat": 128, "identifier": "jSxIEczLD0", "start_s": 628.16, "end_s": 631.21, "timestamp": "10m28s-10m31s", "filename": "128_10m28s-10m31s.png", "text": "The programs still work exactly as designed."},
  {"beat": 129, "identifier": "Ia8ZWp6tvE", "start_s": 631.21, "end_s": 634.26, "timestamp": "10m31s-10m34s", "filename": "129_10m31s-10m34s.png", "text": "They were just never designed for this."},
  {"beat": 130, "identifier": "wPUCbgq7EI", "start_s": 634.26, "end_s": 636.88, "timestamp": "10m34s-10m37s", "filename": "130_10m34s-10m37s.png", "text": "Same trap. Different label. Same result."},
  {"beat": 131, "identifier": "ONJQ1Pfynm", "start_s": 636.88, "end_s": 641.24, "timestamp": "10m37s-10m41s", "filename": "131_10m37s-10m41s.png", "text": "So which part of this is running in you tonight?"},
  {"beat": 132, "identifier": "y6OFr3YPW9", "start_s": 641.24, "end_s": 649.97, "timestamp": "10m41s-10m50s", "filename": "132_10m41s-10m50s.png", "text": "The excitement of the \"maybe.\" The relief of the fade. Or the quiet refill that just feels like moving on."},
  {"beat": 133, "identifier": "UySfbiYwny", "start_s": 649.97, "end_s": 660.0, "timestamp": "10m50s-11m00s", "filename": "133_10m50s-11m00s.png", "text": "Next week: why your brain treats your future self like a complete stranger — and why that's the real reason you don't save."}
